# Files load in this order, each receiving (addonName, LIR) as its `...`.
# Core first: it creates the shared table, the saved settings and the events
# the other files hook into.
Core.lua
Chat.lua
Usability.lua
Data.lua
Preview.lua
# UI.lua defines the mixins UI.xml's frames name, so it loads first.
UI.lua
UI.xml
Settings.lua
